      "text": [
        "One chair. One barber. Your full hour.",
        "Chair and Blade is a private, one-to-one barber studio in the heart of the Northern Quarter's neighbouring streets. No queue, no shared floor — just a proper conversation and a cut done properly, start to finish, by the same pair of hands every time.",
        "St John Street, Manchester"
      ]
    },
    {
      "top": 682,
