      "carousel": false,
      "figures": 0,
      "text": [
        "Cutting hair on St John Street since day one",
        "Chair and Blade was built around a simple idea: a barber shop doesn't need six chairs to do great work — it needs one, run properly. I trained across Manchester's barbershops for over a decade before deciding the trade-off wasn't worth it anymore. Rushed appointments, three conversations happening a",
        "Here, it's just you and me. Every booking is a fixed slot, every cut gets my full attention, and every client leaves knowing exactly what happened to their hair and why. It's barbering the way it used to be practised, on a quiet street two minutes from the city centre.",
        "— Tom, founder of Chair and Blade",
        "Owner & Barber"
      ]
    },
    {
      "top": 1468,
      "height": 1050,
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "Every service, full attention",
      "cards": 0,
