      "text": [
        "Every service, full attention",
        "No add-on menus, no upselling from a second barber. Prices are fixed and every appointment is timed so it never feels rushed.",
        "First visit includes a proper consultation at no extra charge. Card and contactless payment only — there's no till in a one-chair studio.",
        "Services & Prices",
        "Consultation, wash, precision cut, style finish",
        "Cut & Beard Sculpt",
        "Full haircut with hot towel beard shape and line-up",
        "Precision fade with razor finish and detailing",
        "Beard Trim & Hot Towel",
        "Shape, line-up, and traditional hot towel treatment",
        "Straight Razor Shave",
